WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.771
A String Catalog holds every
language of an iOS app in one

2
00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:08.241
JSON file, and Xcode
syncs it on each build.

3
00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:10.426
Add your languages in Xcode,

4
00:00:10.426 --> 00:00:14.895
and write text with localizable
APIs such as SwiftUI Text.

5
00:00:15.295 --> 00:00:18.963
Then build, and Xcode collects
those strings into the catalog.

6
00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:23.029
General Translation translates
the catalog with each release

7
00:00:23.029 --> 00:00:24.676
and shares its terminology.

8
00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:31.548
Point an xcstrings entry in
gt.config.json at each catalog.

9
00:00:31.948 --> 00:00:35.709
Then run npx gt translate
before the build.

10
00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:38.645
Your team now ships
Spanish with each release.
